.DS_Store

# data/ holds the dialog store (committed on purpose — this repo is PRIVATE and
# doubles as the sync/backup channel for dialogs). Keep secrets and the rolling
# save-backups out of it; API keys live in ~/.config/solveit-sidekick/secrets.json.
data/secrets.json
data/*.bak

# private/local dialog overlays (configured by data/dialogs-<target>.private)
data/dialogs-*.private
data/dialogs-*.local.json
data/dialogs-*.local.json.bak
data/dialogs-*.local.json.tmp

